        <mxCell id="mc_ver" value="&lt;font style='font-size:10px' color='#047857'&gt;&lt;b&gt;[COUNTERFACTUAL]&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:12px' color='#0F172A'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Counterfactual Mission Verification&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10.5px' color='#334155'&gt;mission/verify.py — checks both necessity and sufficiency:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10.5px' color='#334155'&gt;1. Without key / ability: Exit is NOT reachable (locks are unbypassable)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10.5px' color='#334155'&gt;2. With key / ability: Exit IS reachable with 0 soft-locks&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10.5px' color='#334155'&gt;3. Structural fidelity check passes (&amp;#x27;key in cave, door in castle&amp;#x27;)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=1.6;fontColor=#0F172A;fontSize=12;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
